## Lab 5 - Što je trebalo?

| Zahtjev | Bodovi | Status |
|---------|--------|--------|
| **API CRUD + DTO za sve entitete** | **2** | ✅ Gotovo |
| Autentikacija (local accounts) | 1 | ✅ Gotovo |
| Upload datoteka (Dropzone) | 1 | ✅ Gotovo |
| 3rd party login (Google, FB) | 1 | ✅ Gotovo |
| Integracijski testovi | 2 | ✅ Gotovo (3 testa) |

---

## 1️⃣ API CRUD + DTO - Što trebam pokazati?

### **A) Struktura API-ja**

```
Controllers/Api/
├── PlaylistApiController.cs   ← GET/POST/PUT/DELETE
├── SongApiController.cs       ← GET/POST/PUT/DELETE
├── ArtistApiController.cs     ← GET/POST/PUT/DELETE
├── AlbumApiController.cs      ← GET/POST/PUT/DELETE
├── GenreApiController.cs      ← GET/POST/PUT/DELETE
└── UserApiController.cs       ← GET/POST/PUT/DELETE

ViewModels/Api/
└── ApiDtos.cs                 ← Sve DTO klase
```

### **B) Što je DTO?**

**DTO = Data Transfer Object** - klasa koja **transformira podatke iz baze za frontend**.

Primjer:
- **Entitet `Playlist`** iz baze ima 20 polja
- **DTO `PlaylistDto`** ima samo 10 - ona što frontend trebat

Zašto?
1. ✅ Ne izlažemo sve interne podatke
2. ✅ Smanjimo podatke koji se šalju
3. ✅ Kontrolirano što frontend vidi
4. ✅ Lakše promijeniti bazu bez da frontend padne

---

## 2️⃣ Kako pokazati profesoru - PRAKTIČNA DEMO

### **Korak 1: Testovi koji dokazuju da radi**

Pokreni testove - to je **najbolji dokaz**:

```powershell
cd c:\Users\drvoj\Documents\GitHub\aspnet-tvz
dotnet test src/Playlist/Playlist.Tests/Playlist.Tests.csproj -p:UseAppHost=false --verbosity minimal
```

**Rezultat:**
```
Passed!  - Failed: 0, Passed: 3, Skipped: 0
```

To dokazuje:
- ✅ GET sve playliste radi
- ✅ GET playlistu po ID-u radi
- ✅ POST (kreiranje), PUT (update), DELETE rade

---

### **Korak 2: Pokreni aplikaciju i pozovi API**

```powershell
dotnet run -p src/Playlist/Playlist/Playlist.csproj -p:UseAppHost=false --urls http://localhost:5005
```

Zatim otvori u browseru ili Postmanu:

#### **GET - Sve playliste**
```
http://localhost:5005/api/playlist
```

**Odgovor (JSON):**
```json
[
  {
    "playlistId": 1,
    "name": "Sludge Doom Vibes",
    "description": "Heavy vibes",
    "isPublic": true,
    "owner": {
      "userId": 1,
      "username": "hrc"
    },
    "songs": [
      {
        "songId": 1,
        "title": "Blank",
        "artist": "Eyehategod",
        "genre": "Sludge Metal"
      }
    ],
    "attachments": []
  }
]
```

#### **GET - Jedna playlista po ID-u**
```
http://localhost:5005/api/playlist/1
```

#### **Pretraga**
```
http://localhost:5005/api/playlist?search=Sludge
```

---

## 3️⃣ Detaljno objašnjenje - Što je API?

### **Bez API-ja** (MVC klasično):
```
Browser → Server → Vraća HTML stranicu → Browser prikazuje
```

### **Sa API-jem** (što vi radite):
```
Browser/Mobilna app → Server → Vraća JSON podatke → Frontend prikazuje
```

**Prednost:** Isti server služi HTML, mobilnu app, JavaScript aplikaciju, druge servere...

---

## 4️⃣ Kako API radi - Primjer PlaylistApiController

### **Kontroler - definira rute**

[Pročitaj](src/Playlist/Playlist/Controllers/Api/PlaylistApiController.cs#L1-L50):

```csharp
[ApiController]
[Route("api/playlist")]
[Authorize]  // ← Trebam biti login
public class PlaylistApiController : ControllerBase
{
    private readonly MusicBarDbContext _context;

    public PlaylistApiController(MusicBarDbContext context)
    {
        _context = context;
    }

    // GET /api/playlist
    [AllowAnonymous]  // ← Svi mogu vidjeti
    [HttpGet]
    public ActionResult<IEnumerable<PlaylistDto>> Get([FromQuery] string? search)
    {
        var query = _context.Playlists
            .Include(p => p.Owner)
            .Include(p => p.Songs)
            .Include(p => p.Attachments)
            .AsQueryable();

        if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(search))
        {
            search = search.Trim().ToLower();
            query = query.Where(p => p.Name.ToLower().Contains(search));
        }

        return Ok(query.AsNoTracking().ToList().Select(p => p.ToDto()));
    }

    // GET /api/playlist/1
    [AllowAnonymous]
    [HttpGet("{id}")]
    public ActionResult<PlaylistDto> Get(int id)
    {
        var playlist = _context.Playlists
            .Include(p => p.Owner)
            .Include(p => p.Songs)
            .Include(p => p.Attachments)
            .FirstOrDefault(p => p.PlaylistId == id);

        if (playlist == null)
            return NotFound();

        return Ok(playlist.ToDto());
    }

    // POST /api/playlist - kreiraj novu
    [HttpPost]
    [Authorize(Roles = "Admin,Manager")]  // ← Samo admin/manager
    public ActionResult<PlaylistDto> Post([FromBody] PlaylistCreateUpdateDto model)
    {
        var playlist = new Playlist
        {
            Name = model.Name,
            Description = model.Description,
            IsPublic = model.IsPublic,
            OwnerId = model.OwnerId ?? 0,
            CreatedAt = DateTime.Now
        };

        _context.Playlists.Add(playlist);
        _context.SaveChanges();

        return CreatedAtAction(nameof(Get), new { id = playlist.PlaylistId }, playlist.ToDto());
    }

    // PUT /api/playlist/1 - ažurira
    [HttpPut("{id}")]
    [Authorize(Roles = "Admin,Manager")]
    public ActionResult<PlaylistDto> Put(int id, [FromBody] PlaylistCreateUpdateDto model)
    {
        var playlist = _context.Playlists.Find(id);
        if (playlist == null)
            return NotFound();

        playlist.Name = model.Name;
        playlist.Description = model.Description;
        playlist.IsPublic = model.IsPublic;

        _context.SaveChanges();
        return Ok(playlist.ToDto());
    }

    // DELETE /api/playlist/1 - briše
    [HttpDelete("{id}")]
    [Authorize(Roles = "Admin")]  // ← Samo admin
    public IActionResult Delete(int id)
    {
        var playlist = _context.Playlists.Find(id);
        if (playlist == null)
            return NotFound();

        _context.Playlists.Remove(playlist);
        _context.SaveChanges();

        return NoContent();
    }
}
